WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.504 --> 00:00:18.068
Allô ? Agence Voyage Plus, bonjour.
Hello? Voyage Plus agency, good morning.

2
00:00:18.168 --> 00:00:23.612
Bonjour, je voudrais parler à Madame Dupont, s'il vous plaît.
Hello, I'd like to speak to Madame Dupont, please.

3
00:00:23.712 --> 00:00:28.868
Elle n'est pas là. Vous voulez laisser un message ?
She isn't here. Would you like to leave a message?

4
00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:33.188
Oui, pouvez-vous lui dire que je rappelle demain ?
Yes, can you tell her that I'll call back tomorrow?

5
00:00:33.288 --> 00:00:38.012
Bien sûr. C'est de la part de qui ?
Of course. Who shall I say is calling?

6
00:00:38.112 --> 00:00:43.292
Adrien Martin. Merci, au revoir !
Adrien Martin. Thank you, goodbye!
